        "type": "writing",
        "title": "An increasing number of people today change their career and place of residence several times during their lives. Is this a positive or negative development?",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X9hSdiGzsoZFlixnpA5l4d8vg6c\"><em><strong>An increasing number of people today change their career and place of residence several times during their lives. Is this a positive or negative development?</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/essay-structure-logical-framework\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Theo Logical Framework &copy;</a></strong></span></h3>\n<h2 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\"><span style=\"color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\"><u><strong>1.</strong></u><u><strong> Hiểu đề &amp; viết Introduction:</strong></u></span></h2>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N3rMdv4zAo1jGpxg5FYlWXGFggb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Đề cho 1 xu hướng:</strong> Ng&agrave;y c&agrave;ng nhiều người thay đổi sự nghiệp v&agrave; nơi cư tr&uacute; nhiều lần trong đời.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O0QrdAMv7oilThxPJ5wlCi6mgHp\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Dạng c&acirc;u hỏi:</strong> Đ&acirc;y l&agrave; một xu hướng t&iacute;ch cực hay ti&ecirc;u cực?</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FL7id1P5PoeP9GxtckAlXjQLgKc\">Dựa v&agrave;o đề b&agrave;i v&agrave; c&acirc;u hỏi, ch&uacute;ng ta c&oacute; thể viết được phần Introduction. Theo <strong>Logical Framework &copy;</strong>, phần Introduction lu&ocirc;n c&oacute; 2 c&acirc;u:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RAB3dnRwhoeC1Wx60mOlZ5Zkgsg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 1: </strong>Paraphrase đề b&agrave;i</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DFFwdCaMRo6xOJxKGselA3gxgZc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 2: </strong>Thesis statement - Trả lời c&acirc;u hỏi</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M6ordzij2ohuP6xzg5NlC85JgOh\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing:</strong></div>\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Z4XudfzsWo1hYxxjtZAlg93tgFb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>switch careers (<em>thay đổi sự nghiệp</em>)</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y67HdDn1po7qg5xNouUlXY5tgUh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>relocate multiple times (<em>thay đổi nơi ở nhiều lần</em>)</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AUxLdwnbKof5AxxE7qFlhlHMgTg\">\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\">\n<h2 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\"><u><strong>2.</strong></u><u><strong> Gợi &yacute; lập luận &amp; ph&acirc;n body:</strong></u></span></h2>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Pklmddy9Bo7tzyxz8N8lq70Dgyb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FpNbd7IdBoA4Ctx6gxsl4JN5gie\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OWsUdfdiSo5zJSxHBAElqPqPgMf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DnoWda9NLoogFOxHQgvljDWwgQI\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y0VTdv3RjoVBMUxyY6glDwkugHc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xxw3dzwzloLfvMx31Ozl4U5Rgdd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GNJ6d5ipHoc8XKxmUm7lK2WGgfe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IbjJdoy4ooQvOuxYcF4lOk6kgMf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TrXedfmpHoDN5oxYJwclLFK5g8d\">Bạn n&ecirc;n thảo luận mỗi quan điểm v&agrave; đưa ra &yacute; kiến c&aacute; nh&acirc;n của m&igrave;nh về việc ủng hộ quan điểm n&agrave;o. Ở đ&acirc;y, theo <strong>Logical Framework &copy;</strong> với <strong>c&aacute;ch lập luận 40/60</strong>, YouPass tin rằng <strong>'xu hướng n&agrave;y sẽ mang lại nhiều t&aacute;c động t&iacute;ch cực hơn l&agrave; ti&ecirc;u cực. </strong>Với c&aacute;ch lập luận n&agrave;y, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ sắp xếp &yacute; tưởng v&agrave;o 2 body như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B8nVd6ui7oPyVMxWilEloA8Sgfb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Body 1:</strong> Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y về những th&aacute;ch thức (ti&ecirc;u cực) m&agrave; xu hướng n&agrave;y mang lại.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UeCkdNayooZiasxvZUwlLX1Ag6e\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Body 2:</strong> Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y quan điểm c&aacute; nh&acirc;n, tập trung v&agrave;o những lợi &iacute;ch (t&iacute;ch cực) đ&aacute;ng kể hơn.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HEkZdVl0Loexrnx8bSzlHBRBg3D\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E6xsduRXyo7PgoxfRdNlJsyWgCb\">Nếu bạn chưa nắm vững về cấu tr&uacute;c đoạn văn v&agrave; logic ph&aacute;t triển &yacute; theo <strong>Logical Framework &copy; </strong>th&igrave; bạn h&atilde;y xem c&aacute;c b&agrave;i học sau trước khi viết b&agrave;i theo gợi &yacute; ở bước 3 nh&eacute;:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZCi8dUtrIoNNTTx7gl3llDpYgUL\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><u><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/cau-truc-doan-van\" target=\"_self\">Logic sắp xếp th&ocirc;ng tin trong paragraph</a></strong></u></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jvy7dry7XoJRCyx1bgulj2smgZf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><u><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-reason-impact\" target=\"_self\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Reason v&agrave; Impact</a></strong></u></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DqjpdMqWWoiZ5lxsEK7lpzBagSh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><u><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-example\" target=\"_self\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Example</a></strong></u></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\">\n<h2 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\"><u><strong>3.</strong></u><u><strong> Viết Body 1:</strong></u></span></h2>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\">Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y về những th&aacute;ch thức (ti&ecirc;u cực) m&agrave; xu hướng n&agrave;y mang lại.</span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kk5gd8w6foneJkxtmd7ld1C4grP\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OTuvdKP8xofWPhxe3dnljyPXgvd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GGx2dtMsVo2SRMxTaHOlDGY0gIh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OUsndgv96oXwDFxW1FrloHVrgAe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GRTBdEWugofGoixOPJblvMOygNU\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CqPEd28cco0ycmxZHuQlljkHgMe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T4nldWXyRoUmvgxl7nOldzdAgIf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CizadgB9moHAc1xIKRIlK0EVgAz\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TYRIdhFgWoNmKuxEEpklKyzbgMh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FZHPdYYU5oHSRix4IyWlo1lTgSO\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YUASdElQvoKx2dxK8CPlNySngNh\"><strong>Topic sentence:</strong> Phải thừa nhận rằng, những người thường xuy&ecirc;n thay đổi <em>c&ocirc;ng việc v&agrave; nơi cư tr&uacute; (jobs and residences)</em> c&oacute; thể gặp phải một số kh&oacute; khăn li&ecirc;n quan đến <em>ổn định t&agrave;i ch&iacute;nh (financial stability)</em> v&agrave; <em>sức khỏe t&acirc;m l&yacute; (psychological well-being)</em>.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EhAKduRVtozGhBxiB00lJOeJgpg\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BRGIdxov0obAOGxmVkplSD9Hgef\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 1:</strong> Thay đổi c&ocirc;ng việc thường xuy&ecirc;n c&oacute; thể dẫn đến c&aacute;c <em>giai đoạn thất nghiệp (periods of unemployment)</em>, khiến c&aacute; nh&acirc;n gặp kh&oacute; khăn trong việc <em>lập kế hoạch t&agrave;i ch&iacute;nh (plan their finances)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SGkvdtV7QocvBrxOjKjlKyzfgxW\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Impact:</strong> <em>Nguồn thu nhập (income stream) kh&ocirc;ng ổn định (unpredictable)</em> -&gt; nhiều người kh&oacute; tiết kiệm <em>đủ tiền (sufficient money)</em> cho c&aacute;c khoản chi lớn v&iacute; dụ như nh&agrave; hoặc xe -&gt; ảnh hưởng đ&aacute;ng kể đến chất lượng cuộc sống.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LomRd9TpyoUvLcx5E0LlplmegOd\"><strong>Supporting idea 2:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MRsjdZr5GoBlAvxKQPWlySqQgtg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 2:</strong> Li&ecirc;n tục th&iacute;ch nghi với <em>m&ocirc;i trường l&agrave;m việc v&agrave; cộng đồng (work environments and communities)</em> mới c&oacute; thể tạo ra <em>&aacute;p lực tinh thần (mental pressure</em>) đ&aacute;ng kể.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QkeOdtcpUor6lwxT5RllVJIqg3d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Impact:</strong> Qu&aacute; tr&igrave;nh th&iacute;ch nghi li&ecirc;n tục n&agrave;y thường dẫn đến lo lắng về việc <em>h&ograve;a nhập với đồng nghiệp mới (fitting in with new colleagues)</em> v&agrave; x&acirc;y dựng c&aacute;c mối quan hệ c&oacute; &yacute; nghĩa trong c&aacute;c <em>cộng đồng kh&ocirc;ng quen thuộc (unfamiliar communities)</em> -&gt; c&oacute; thể dẫn đến cảm gi&aacute;c <em>c&ocirc; lập v&agrave; mất kết nối x&atilde; hội (isolation and social disconnection)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\">\n<h2 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\"><u><strong>4.</strong></u><u><strong> Viết Body 2:</strong></u></span></h2>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\">Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y&nbsp;quan điểm c&aacute; nh&acirc;n, tập trung v&agrave;o những lợi &iacute;ch (t&iacute;ch cực) đ&aacute;ng kể hơn.</span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KrtVdtupRoKL6sxjDB2lsqewgkf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IpmcdM2KVo20yvx1AcclbEoFgNe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WdeNdWsDkoHkxfxFq99lekOpgte\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Zq8Ed5ZPxoJixmxjWwPlsAd9gQ8\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q9QVdRGxLozW5JxLNrOlZt4TgTh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ec7GdL8hOopk25xWQG2llrpWgfd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S88bdXvGSorowHxwaxulSLSbgsh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-An7YdeKksognslxRwyBlLIxig1c\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UcaTd0qtvosLXNxEWJYl86aqguf\"><strong>Topic sentence:</strong> Tuy nhi&ecirc;n, t&ocirc;i tin rằng những nhược điểm n&agrave;y bị lu mờ bởi những lợi thế đ&aacute;ng kể m&agrave; lối sống n&agrave;y mang lại.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UBcIdayxBoQudvx40eflulutgEJ\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y0RWdd0gGohd0Ax0nyXl0nU8gxh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 1:</strong> Lợi &iacute;ch đầu ti&ecirc;n l&agrave; <em>sự ph&aacute;t triển c&aacute; nh&acirc;n (personal development)</em> th&ocirc;ng qua <em>những trải nghiệm đa dạng (diverse experiences)</em>, v&igrave; việc tiếp x&uacute;c với c&aacute;c <em>văn h&oacute;a l&agrave;m việc (work cultures)</em> v&agrave; <em>m&ocirc;i trường sống kh&aacute;c nhau (living environments)</em> cho ph&eacute;p mọi người ph&aacute;t triển kỹ năng mới v&agrave; <em>mở rộng tầm nh&igrave;n (broaden their perspectives)</em> đ&aacute;ng kể .</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LVmDdpcQZou1gtxLfvDliE7Ag0c\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Impact: </strong>Họ trở th&agrave;nh những c&aacute; nh&acirc;n <em>dễ th&iacute;ch nghi v&agrave; tự tin (adaptable and confident)</em> hơn -&gt; c&oacute; thể xử l&yacute; nhiều th&aacute;ch thức kh&aacute;c nhau một c&aacute;ch hiệu quả -&gt; đồng thời duy tr&igrave; <em>tư duy to&agrave;n cầu (global mindset)</em> c&oacute; gi&aacute; trị trong thế giới kết nối ng&agrave;y nay.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RmyjdZ9o8opKQSxeuvdlQjv7goe\"><strong>Supporting idea 2:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VrffdGtWqoUrsWxhqQil9vG8gDf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 2:</strong> Những người sẵn s&agrave;ng <em>thay đổi nơi ở v&agrave; sự nghiệp (relocate and switch careers)</em> c&oacute; thể tiếp cận thị trường việc l&agrave;m rộng lớn hơn nhiều -&gt; cho ph&eacute;p họ t&igrave;m được những vị tr&iacute; ph&ugrave; hợp hơn với kỹ năng v&agrave; sở th&iacute;ch.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PYYbdi98XonchyxON1jlisbJguh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Impact:</strong> Sự linh hoạt n&agrave;y cuối c&ugrave;ng dẫn đến mức lương cao hơn v&agrave; <em>triển vọng nghề nghiệp (career prospects)</em> tốt hơn so với việc ở một địa điểm -&gt; gi&uacute;p họ đạt được <em>sự thỏa m&atilde;n nghề nghiệp (professional fulfillment)</em> v&agrave; <em>th&agrave;nh c&ocirc;ng kinh tế (economic success)</em> lớn hơn.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<h2 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\"><u><strong>5.</strong></u><u><strong> Viết Conclusion:</strong></u></span></h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QkOnd9VeToRuWPxTqkUlIuw9gif\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jx3IdxsyToocMyxrcHBlR5M4gTb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Z215dilK9oetfOxPDFol02JKgkg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JRbGdLxfwoyo3LxfaWvlKYZxgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S41gdx1Yho0RQhxH1Zclco4KgPH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MDkodyWDGo2nbTx3llNlDkiTgye\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bx6adWi8AoLDF0xo9FAl8FSSgig\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y8TJdaqR0oT0n0xPP4JlvEIWg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Wx2adUP2GoZ4bwxAGtSlFbGzg5e\">Bạn h&atilde;y viết Conclusion bằng c&aacute;ch <strong>t&oacute;m tắt c&aacute;c luận điểm ch&iacute;nh v&agrave; khẳng định lại quan điểm</strong> của m&igrave;nh nh&eacute;!</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y2ludgo4OokMAXxI7XBlboYqgug\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing:</strong></div>\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YdlPdqIm7oFNU8x4jNLlhDiKguf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>career and residence mobility (<em>sự linh hoạt trong sự nghiệp v&agrave; nơi ở</em>)</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JCSadQHS5oJnDExIrDBl9ByugwS\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>financial and emotional challenges (<em>những th&aacute;ch thức về t&agrave;i ch&iacute;nh v&agrave; cảm x&uacute;c</em>)</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VWRjdur5BoANTRxlnCQlQZZSg6e\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>personal growth and professional opportunities (<em>sự ph&aacute;t triển c&aacute; nh&acirc;n v&agrave; cơ hội nghề nghiệp</em>)</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 2264,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<p>An increasing number of individuals nowadays switch careers and relocate multiple times throughout their lives. Although this trend may create certain challenges, I believe the benefits it brings are far more significant.</p>",
            "question_id": 18893,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2265,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<p><strong>Admittedly, people who frequently change jobs and residences may encounter some difficulties related to financial stability and psychological well-being.</strong> <span style=\"color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\">First of all, one major concern is that changing jobs frequently often leads to periods of unemployment, which makes it challenging for individuals to plan their finances effectively. Since their income stream remains unpredictable, many people struggle to save sufficient money for major purchases such as houses or cars, which can significantly impact their quality of life. </span><span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">Moreover, constantly adjusting to new work environments and communities can create considerable mental pressure that affects their overall well-being. This continuous adaptation process frequently results in anxiety about fitting in with new colleagues and building meaningful relationships within unfamiliar communities, which can lead to feelings of isolation and social disconnection.</span></p>",
            "question_id": 18893,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2266,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<p><strong>However, I am convinced that these drawbacks are overshadowed by the substantial advantages this lifestyle offers. </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\">The first benefit is personal development through diverse experiences, as exposure to different work cultures and living environments enables people to develop new skills and broaden their perspectives significantly. As a result, they become more adaptable and confident individuals who can handle various challenges effectively while maintaining a global mindset that proves valuable in today's interconnected world.</span><span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"> Furthermore, those willing to relocate and switch careers gain access to a much wider job market, which allows them to find positions that better match their skills and interests. This flexibility ultimately leads to higher salaries and better career prospects compared to remaining in one location, enabling them to achieve greater professional fulfillment and economic success.</span></p>",
            "question_id": 18893,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2267,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Conclusion",
            "value": "<p>In conclusion, while career and residence mobility may involve certain financial and emotional challenges, I believe the benefits in terms of personal growth and professional opportunities are substantially more significant.</p>",
